# Applies only to a build whose context is codigo/ itself -- currently just
# codigo/despliegue/Caddy.Dockerfile (it needs both frontend/ and
# despliegue/ in one context). backend/ and frontend/'s own Dockerfiles use
# their own .dockerignore next to them and are unaffected by this file.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.git
data/raw
**/.env
